  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Depreciation: finding the annual rate (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A {@asset@} was bought for Ksh \( {@P0@} \). After \( {@T0@} \) years its value had fallen to Ksh \( {@A0@} \).</p>
<p>(a) By what percentage has the value fallen over the \( {@T0@} \) years altogether?</p>
<div>Total decrease \( = \) [[input:ans1]] \( \% \) [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Assuming it depreciated at a steady compound rate, find the annual rate of depreciation.</p>
<div>\( R = \) [[input:ans2]] \( \% \) per annum [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> \( \dfrac{P - A}{P} \times 100\% = \dfrac{ {@P0 - A0@} }{ {@P0@} } \times 100\% = {@rd(totp)@}\% \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> Rearrange \( A = P\left(1 - \frac{R}{100}\right)^T \):</p>
\[
\begin{align*}
\frac{A}{P} = \frac{ {@A0@} }{ {@P0@} } = {@float(A0/P0)@} &= \left(1 - \frac{R}{100}\right)^{ {@T0@} } \\
1 - \frac{R}{100} &= \sqrt[{@T0@}]{ {@float(A0/P0)@} } = {@float(1 - R0/100)@} \\
R &= 100 \times (1 - {@float(1 - R0/100)@}) = {@R0@}\%.
\end{align*}
\]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
